NAME
    edit - a line-oriented text editor

SYNOPSIS
    edit name

DESCRIPTION
    A simple line editor for creating and changing text files over the
    serial console, without needing a full-screen terminal (unlike vi).
    Lines are numbered; you list, insert, replace, and delete by number,
    then write the file out. edit is a /bin program (a TPA program run at
    $7A00).

EXAMPLES
    edit hello.asm
    run /bin/edit.bin notes.txt

SEE ALSO
    vi, asm, cat
